  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Genome - Chromosphaera perkinsii (2017) in Figshare. 1 citation.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Genome - Chromosphaera perkinsii (2017) in Figshare is authored by the authors. Topics: Biology, Genome, Computational biology, Genetics and Gene.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">1 citations (OpenAlex). Citing venues include eLife.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
